1
00:01:20,974 --> 00:01:25,754
I'm not going to die, I'm not going to die

2
00:01:51,814 --> 00:01:55,454
Please, everyone, I beg
you, won't you help me?

3
00:01:57,094 --> 00:01:57,924
NAKAM!

4
00:01:58,194 --> 00:02:01,831
NAKAM has always had a weakness for
your basic, conventional beauty.

5
00:02:01,914 --> 00:02:04,090
But I prefer the cute, devilish type.

6
00:02:04,274 --> 00:02:07,980
I guarantee you, no well-bred
young lady is gonna blow my mind.

7
00:02:08,654 --> 00:02:09,594
So cute!

8
00:02:09,794 --> 00:02:10,694
I just can't!

9
00:02:11,354 --> 00:02:13,054
Suki! Are you okay?

10
00:02:13,334 --> 00:02:16,514
Hang in there, man! My
brain! My brain! Crap!

11
00:02:16,694 --> 00:02:17,991
Well, it's gonna be okay,

12
00:02:18,074 --> 00:02:20,751
Because the only thing this
man goes for are slightly

13
00:02:20,834 --> 00:02:23,051
depressed girls who suddenly
give you an embarrassed,

14
00:02:23,134 --> 00:02:24,154
unexpected smile.

15
00:02:24,474 --> 00:02:27,011
She can't possibly be all
those types wrapped up in one,

16
00:02:27,094 --> 00:02:29,212
even if she is a real-life princess.

17
00:02:29,374 --> 00:02:32,315
And now, our honored hero
will make an appearance.

18
00:02:36,114 --> 00:02:38,454
Come on, hero, give us a smile.

19
00:02:43,614 --> 00:02:45,654
Justice is on our side!

20
00:02:54,674 --> 00:02:56,391
Amazing head maid! Thank you,

21
00:02:56,474 --> 00:02:58,251
the uniforms you procured
and your instructions

22
00:02:58,334 --> 00:03:01,214
on how to behave made everything so easy!

23
00:03:02,054 --> 00:03:03,871
How did things end up like this?

24
00:03:03,954 --> 00:03:07,072
And why do I have to get up
on stage like a pop idol?

25
00:03:07,314 --> 00:03:09,214
This skirt is way too short!

26
00:03:09,394 --> 00:03:11,251
It feels so dangerous and drafty!

27
00:03:11,334 --> 00:03:13,091
The thought that my that which must not be

28
00:03:13,174 --> 00:03:15,939
seen might be seen is
about to drive me insane!

29
00:03:16,194 --> 00:03:18,371
If I get too cold it might upset my tummy!

30
00:03:18,454 --> 00:03:21,991
I can't believe that I'm missing
the stupid tides I usually wear!

31
00:03:22,074 --> 00:03:24,851
Plus, I can't shake this
intense feeling of shame!

32
00:03:24,934 --> 00:03:26,214
I'd rather be naked!

33
00:03:27,294 --> 00:03:29,414
I can't do this! I've gotta change!

34
00:03:32,574 --> 00:03:36,045
Princess, I think it might be
time to begin the next phase.

35
00:03:36,234 --> 00:03:37,587
And what phase is that?

36
00:03:38,174 --> 00:03:39,854
We need an armed uprising.

37
00:03:40,654 --> 00:03:42,594
No, violence is uncivilized.

38
00:03:42,814 --> 00:03:45,991
I've asked our dear citizens
to help us, so I won't do that.

39
00:03:46,074 --> 00:03:48,309
I simply can't have them getting hurt.

40
00:03:49,554 --> 00:03:51,971
At most, we'll use starvation tactics.

41
00:03:52,054 --> 00:03:54,878
I'll make them capitulate
without any bloodshed.

42
00:03:55,354 --> 00:03:56,295
Yes, understood.

43
00:03:56,494 --> 00:03:58,259
As you will it, your highness.

44
00:04:01,814 --> 00:04:02,644
Hold on.

45
00:04:02,794 --> 00:04:05,431
It's been a year since you
started serving me, right?

46
00:04:05,514 --> 00:04:07,891
There are only two reasons
I've come this far.

47
00:04:07,974 --> 00:04:11,254
The hero and the plan you
thought up. Thank you.

48
00:04:13,794 --> 00:04:15,134
If you'll excuse me.

49
00:04:15,414 --> 00:04:17,014
Yes, I'll leave it to you.

50
00:04:23,914 --> 00:04:25,634
That is so much better!

51
00:04:26,134 --> 00:04:27,605
This is how it should be!

52
00:04:28,114 --> 00:04:30,349
The rebellion isn't going away, is it?

53
00:04:30,534 --> 00:04:32,371
Which means I'm gonna have to keep wearing

54
00:04:32,454 --> 00:04:35,219
this uniform in front of
huge crowds of people!

55
00:04:37,734 --> 00:04:39,394
Okay, I'll run away!

56
00:04:39,814 --> 00:04:40,694
Sorry Eggie!

57
00:04:40,894 --> 00:04:45,306
I'm just not ready to be out here trying
to tempt people with my bare legs!

58
00:04:46,694 --> 00:04:47,774
It's a hero!

59
00:04:48,094 --> 00:04:49,794
The hero has showed herself!

60
00:04:50,574 --> 00:04:51,434
This hero!

61
00:04:52,054 --> 00:04:54,878
Just show us the way,
we'll follow you anywhere!

62
00:04:57,054 --> 00:05:00,230
Guess I'll look for the tiara
the handmaid took first.

63
00:05:04,454 --> 00:05:07,374
No idea where I should
start looking, though.

64
00:05:08,534 --> 00:05:09,614
Is someone there?

65
00:05:10,514 --> 00:05:11,344
Eh?

66
00:05:18,294 --> 00:05:19,124
Thank you!

67
00:05:19,274 --> 00:05:22,371
When the headmaid caught me, I had
no idea what I was going to do.

68
00:05:22,454 --> 00:05:24,711
For a sec, I thought you were
doing this recreationally.

69
00:05:24,794 --> 00:05:26,029
That'll be a hard no.

70
00:05:26,494 --> 00:05:28,611
Why don't you come back with me for now?

71
00:05:28,694 --> 00:05:31,106
I know Jinguji is worried about you, too.

72
00:05:32,014 --> 00:05:33,485
You better not follow me!

73
00:05:34,134 --> 00:05:37,151
I was just thinking about
how he hasn't come to get me.

74
00:05:37,234 --> 00:05:40,058
Not very gallant, but I
know what he's thinking.

75
00:05:40,414 --> 00:05:42,631
Why don't you go travel
with the princess, then?

76
00:05:42,714 --> 00:05:44,554
Oh, that's so Jinguuji.

77
00:05:48,154 --> 00:05:49,894
I did not need to do that!

78
00:05:50,374 --> 00:05:51,454
Is someone there?

79
00:05:51,714 --> 00:05:52,994
Oh, that's not good.

80
00:05:53,154 --> 00:05:54,014
Sorry, Muriya!

81
00:05:58,234 --> 00:05:59,294
Oh, Kate!

82
00:05:59,754 --> 00:06:01,854
Please, don't leave me behind!

83
00:06:04,494 --> 00:06:05,594
This sucks.

84
00:06:05,814 --> 00:06:07,226
I'm completely helpless.

85
00:06:19,814 --> 00:06:22,394
Oh, everything's going wrong! Breathe.

86
00:06:22,754 --> 00:06:24,191
I've made it through everything that's

87
00:06:24,274 --> 00:06:26,951
happened to me in this
world one way or another.

88
00:06:27,034 --> 00:06:29,954
No, I can't even delude myself that far.

89
00:06:30,754 --> 00:06:34,048
Jinguji's the one that helped
me survive all this chaos.

90
00:06:36,494 --> 00:06:37,324
boss.

91
00:06:37,407 --> 00:06:38,237
I'm no hero.

92
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:41,774
Wow, you know, Tachibana, it's
amazing that Jinguji puts up with you

93
00:06:43,514 --> 00:06:44,926
considering how you are.

94
00:06:45,014 --> 00:06:47,331
Are you sure he doesn't think
of you as a pain in the butt?

95
00:06:47,414 --> 00:06:48,244
What am

96
00:06:55,074 --> 00:06:56,311
I even doing here?

97
00:06:56,394 --> 00:06:58,551
Oh, honored hero. Are you well?

98
00:06:58,634 --> 00:07:02,691
Does the fragrance of the tea
not suit Your tastes oh no it's

99
00:07:02,774 --> 00:07:07,734
not that headmaid can I ask you
am I really being useful here?

100
00:07:08,414 --> 00:07:11,514
It seems you might be a
little tired honored hero!

101
00:07:13,794 --> 00:07:19,334
Leave everything to me I'll take care of
it what is that and where is it gonna go?

102
00:07:28,994 --> 00:07:30,214
How is it?

103
00:07:30,714 --> 00:07:31,674
It's the best!

104
00:07:36,174 --> 00:07:38,354
Hey, what is this slippery stuff?

105
00:07:39,294 --> 00:07:40,124
Slime.

106
00:07:40,854 --> 00:07:43,134
The beauty secret of the royal family.

107
00:07:43,434 --> 00:07:45,511
Beauty is a strange thing, isn't it?

108
00:07:45,594 --> 00:07:48,182
It has the power to
seduce or guide someone.

109
00:07:49,774 --> 00:07:55,311
Thanks to your beauty, honored hero,
her highness's wishes, and granted so?

110
00:07:55,394 --> 00:07:58,571
Yes, I Think you're
being quite helpful, huh?

111
00:07:58,654 --> 00:08:01,191
Wow, thanks for saying so!

112
00:08:01,274 --> 00:08:03,531
You don't know how Much
I needed to hear that!

113
00:08:03,614 --> 00:08:07,631
Lots of stuff has happened
since I came here to this World,

114
00:08:07,714 --> 00:08:10,871
but Chinkoji is the one
who's dealt with all of it.

115
00:08:10,954 --> 00:08:14,411
I just wish he Understood how often
I feel like he doesn't need me.

116
00:08:14,494 --> 00:08:16,911
I mean, I know he's super Tired.

117
00:08:16,994 --> 00:08:21,131
Actually, I keep thinking that it's
possible he could die because of me.

118
00:08:21,214 --> 00:08:22,411
I don't understand!

119
00:08:22,494 --> 00:08:24,671
How did things end up like this?

120
00:08:24,754 --> 00:08:29,574
I've heard tell that your body was
bestowed upon you by the goddess

121
00:08:30,734 --> 00:08:33,734
And you continue to face
danger due to your beauty.

122
00:08:34,354 --> 00:08:38,274
Your body's too frail to defend
itself, which makes me think

123
00:08:40,374 --> 00:08:42,471
The goddess is the true
cause of everything.

124
00:08:42,554 --> 00:08:43,384
Is she not?

125
00:08:44,634 --> 00:08:46,414
So it wasn't my fault?

126
00:08:46,594 --> 00:08:48,359
This is all the goddesses bad?

127
00:08:48,574 --> 00:08:51,927
Honored hero, I can understand
what you're going through.

128
00:08:52,254 --> 00:08:54,234
It may be presumptuous of me.

129
00:08:54,454 --> 00:08:58,454
But if you'll allow me, I would
very much like to help Grant here.

130
00:09:05,514 --> 00:09:09,194
Yep, the best snack to pair
with a drink has to be...

131
00:09:09,794 --> 00:09:11,134
Ta-da! Squid!

132
00:09:12,494 --> 00:09:14,771
It's time to look after
my little ones on the

133
00:09:14,854 --> 00:09:17,442
ground while enjoying
a yummy evening drink.

134
00:09:20,154 --> 00:09:21,034
What's this?

135
00:09:21,274 --> 00:09:24,131
Have I finally started
interfering directly then?

136
00:09:24,214 --> 00:09:25,814
You're jealous, aren't you?

137
00:09:26,354 --> 00:09:29,851
Even though it's you who truly
possesses the status of hero,

138
00:09:29,934 --> 00:09:32,071
Jinguji keeps blatantly ignoring that?

139
00:09:32,154 --> 00:09:34,771
and now you find yourself
envying him, don't you?

140
00:09:34,854 --> 00:09:35,684
Yeah.

141
00:09:35,994 --> 00:09:38,971
Let's try keeping our
distance from him for a while

142
00:09:39,054 --> 00:09:40,694
and you will gain power.

143
00:09:41,454 --> 00:09:43,694
I will teach you how to do so.

144
00:09:44,934 --> 00:09:45,764
Yeah.

145
00:09:46,254 --> 00:09:52,054
And then we'll be able to show everyone
what an outstanding human you truly are.

146
00:09:52,534 --> 00:09:53,364
Yeah.

147
00:09:55,914 --> 00:09:58,149
I had a dream about when I was little.

148
00:09:58,234 --> 00:10:00,151
My vision was blurred with tears,

149
00:10:00,234 --> 00:10:03,293
so I'm guessing it might
not have been a good dream.

150
00:10:04,874 --> 00:10:09,462
I feel like elementary school was when
there was the most irrational violence.

151
00:10:10,234 --> 00:10:11,854
Getting picked on sucks.

152
00:10:12,114 --> 00:10:14,774
It hurts, it's humiliating,
it's frustrating.

153
00:10:15,034 --> 00:10:19,034
Bullies know exactly how to make a
person feel as small as possible.

154
00:10:20,574 --> 00:10:23,654
And I just wished for someone, anyone.

155
00:10:29,434 --> 00:10:32,494
I wanted someone to beat
those guys up for me.

156
00:10:33,054 --> 00:10:34,914
This dude's scary. Let's go.

157
00:10:39,014 --> 00:10:40,031
Hey you okay?

158
00:10:40,114 --> 00:10:43,211
Oh now I get it!

159
00:10:43,294 --> 00:10:46,529
This is my memory of the first
time I ever met Jinguuji.

160
00:10:47,894 --> 00:10:49,691
Hey thanks man! Sure thing!

161
00:10:49,774 --> 00:10:52,656
If somebody's in trouble
it's only right to help!

162
00:10:53,214 --> 00:10:58,034
We were in the same class but he always
kept to himself I didn't understand him.

163
00:10:59,754 --> 00:11:01,091
That was so cool!

164
00:11:01,174 --> 00:11:02,004
Were you doing judo?

165
00:11:02,087 --> 00:11:03,251
You're super strong!

166
00:11:03,334 --> 00:11:04,751
Oh wow!

167
00:11:04,834 --> 00:11:06,871
I guess I'd never thought about it.

168
00:11:06,954 --> 00:11:10,954
But ever since I first met him for real.

169
00:11:13,274 --> 00:11:17,171
I idolized him or maybe was I

170
00:11:17,254 --> 00:11:20,714
jealous of him somehow I feel like I.

171
00:11:26,974 --> 00:11:29,114
I'm a terrible guy.

172
00:11:32,794 --> 00:11:34,771
Oh no did I fall asleep?

173
00:11:34,854 --> 00:11:36,811
Yes part way through!

174
00:11:36,894 --> 00:11:39,914
Ah really I'm sorry about that.

175
00:11:40,774 --> 00:11:43,651
But physically and mentally
I feel so much better!

176
00:11:43,734 --> 00:11:46,051
Thanks for the back rub head maid.

177
00:11:46,134 --> 00:11:47,651
No not at all!

178
00:11:47,734 --> 00:11:49,711
I'm glad to know I've been of use to you!

179
00:11:49,794 --> 00:11:50,711
You must be tired!

180
00:11:50,794 --> 00:11:53,431
I think it's Best if you take
today off and get some sleep!

181
00:11:53,514 --> 00:11:55,091
Great!

182
00:11:55,174 --> 00:11:56,431
Sounds like a plan!

183
00:11:56,514 --> 00:11:58,254
Good night then!

184
00:12:00,534 --> 00:12:01,887
Good night to you, too.

185
00:12:02,274 --> 00:12:04,803
Have an even more
pleasant dream this time.

186
00:12:07,514 --> 00:12:09,074
Ah, that's amazing.

187
00:12:11,434 --> 00:12:14,471
I'm here to report that the
person you requested has arrived.

188
00:12:14,554 --> 00:12:15,384
Is it true?

189
00:12:15,674 --> 00:12:16,931
Let him through, then.

190
00:12:17,014 --> 00:12:17,955
Let him through.

191
00:12:18,214 --> 00:12:19,534
He requested someone.

192
00:12:20,774 --> 00:12:22,734
Um, excuse the intrusion.

193
00:12:23,334 --> 00:12:24,914
So, hey, what do you say?

194
00:12:25,014 --> 00:12:28,014
Is it okay if I come in or
do I just hang out here?

195
00:12:28,874 --> 00:12:30,274
Hey, it's Jinguuji!

196
00:12:30,574 --> 00:12:32,911
I'm so glad there's someone I know here!

197
00:12:32,994 --> 00:12:33,824
Oh, it's you.

198
00:12:33,907 --> 00:12:34,971
Hello there, Schwartz.

199
00:12:35,054 --> 00:12:36,407
It's been a while, huh?

200
00:12:36,654 --> 00:12:37,834
Yes, it really has.

201
00:12:38,014 --> 00:12:39,661
But wait, where's Tachibana?

202
00:12:39,774 --> 00:12:41,131
Currently with the princess.

203
00:12:41,214 --> 00:12:42,044
What?

204
00:12:42,127 --> 00:12:42,957
Princess?

205
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:43,870
There's a princess?

206
00:12:43,953 --> 00:12:45,005
Whoa, I want to meet her!

207
00:12:45,854 --> 00:12:46,684
Think I can?

208
00:12:46,767 --> 00:12:49,871
Actually, I'm about to have an audience
with the king of the entire land,

209
00:12:49,954 --> 00:12:51,251
if you could wrap your head around that.

210
00:12:51,334 --> 00:12:52,614
I barely can myself.

211
00:12:52,794 --> 00:12:56,394
I am super nervous. So weird,
right? For real, though.

212
00:12:57,454 --> 00:12:58,514
Oh, hold on.

213
00:12:58,674 --> 00:13:01,968
Are you sort of waiting for
an audience, too, Jinko-Chi?

214
00:13:02,134 --> 00:13:03,834
Stay calm, Schwarz. Huh?

215
00:13:04,194 --> 00:13:05,974
This is the king of this land.

216
00:13:06,674 --> 00:13:07,504
Ah, indeed.

217
00:13:07,587 --> 00:13:09,114
What an energetic youth!

218
00:13:09,254 --> 00:13:12,019
Just a touch older than
my daughter, I'd guess.

219
00:13:12,894 --> 00:13:14,114
I'm so sorry.

220
00:13:14,314 --> 00:13:16,071
Can I please take that entrance again?

221
00:13:16,154 --> 00:13:18,213
You must do as you wish, of course.

222
00:13:20,594 --> 00:13:22,891
It's a great honor to
meet you, Your Majesty!

223
00:13:22,974 --> 00:13:26,354
As for me, my name is
Schwarz von Liechtensteherr!

224
00:13:27,194 --> 00:13:29,665
Your Majesty, we have given great offense.

225
00:13:30,014 --> 00:13:32,234
No, not at all. Raise your heads.

226
00:13:32,774 --> 00:13:36,598
I know you've suffered many
hardships, so I thank you for coming.

227
00:13:36,814 --> 00:13:39,211
To get straight to the
point, Lord Schwarz.

228
00:13:39,294 --> 00:13:42,294
Due to a rebellion led by
my beloved daughter Iggy,

229
00:13:42,474 --> 00:13:46,011
I'm afraid this kingdom is
currently in a very perilous state.

230
00:13:46,094 --> 00:13:50,151
Her speeches convinced villagers and
castle townsfolk alike to join her,

231
00:13:50,234 --> 00:13:52,031
and they're now a great military force.

232
00:13:52,114 --> 00:13:54,114
Perhaps due to lack of leadership.

233
00:13:54,614 --> 00:13:58,551
A portion of them are now said to be
rioting in an uprising even as we speak.

234
00:13:58,634 --> 00:14:03,458
However, for many years we've been in a
stalemate with the country across the sea.

235
00:14:03,554 --> 00:14:07,991
As such, we have no choice but to continue
focusing our military might there.

236
00:14:08,074 --> 00:14:11,368
That's why we lack the manpower
for a suppression force.

237
00:14:11,534 --> 00:14:14,828
We don't want to use our last
resort if at all possible.

238
00:14:15,454 --> 00:14:16,434
Last resort?

239
00:14:16,994 --> 00:14:18,294
So, what do you say?

240
00:14:18,434 --> 00:14:20,631
Are you willing to save
our kingdom, Lord Schwartz?

241
00:14:20,714 --> 00:14:22,614
Alright, yeah! Let's do it!

242
00:14:23,934 --> 00:14:26,654
Excuse us for a moment. Oh, sure.

243
00:14:30,934 --> 00:14:31,764
Schwarz,

244
00:14:31,847 --> 00:14:34,751
how many times have I told you to stop
answering questions without thinking?

245
00:14:34,834 --> 00:14:36,751
There's a good chance
they'll use your status as

246
00:14:36,834 --> 00:14:39,171
hero to get you caught up
in some nefarious plot.

247
00:14:39,254 --> 00:14:40,651
But Master, I...

248
00:14:40,734 --> 00:14:44,971
If there's rioting, then that means the
village and the people are in danger.

249
00:14:45,054 --> 00:14:48,274
I can think about where I
stand in this later, okay?

250
00:14:48,934 --> 00:14:51,631
If there are people in
trouble, I want to save them.

251
00:14:51,714 --> 00:14:54,067
If my strength can be of any use at all,

252
00:14:54,294 --> 00:14:57,647
then that'll have to be enough
for me right now, alright?

